nodes.body:
Thank you for the updates @bvolpato. lgtm.

Summary: The purpose of the PR is to make sure only generation outputs go through token buffering, so pooling requests don’t error out over missing detokenizer. The PR author added an assert to catch this condition. 

@njhill @yewentao256 @noooop Please feel free to take a second look!

